          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Moses owaco bot Aron ki awobene ni, “Wuted riŋo i doggola kema me rwatte, wucam ki kunnu, kacel ki mugati ma tye i aduku me gityer me ketowu i dog tic, macalo yam aciko kun awaco ni, ‘Aron ki awobene aye gibicamone.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.8.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.8.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 8:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Riŋo ki mugati ma odoŋ myero wuwan awaŋa ki mac, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.8.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.8.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 8:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pe wubikato woko ki i doggola kema me rwatte pi nino abiro, nio ka kare me ketowu i dog tic ocobbe kakare, pien ketowu i dog tic bitero nino abiro. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.8.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.8.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 8:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gin ma gibedo ka tiyone tin, yam Rwot ociko ni gitim me lakwany bal ki i komwu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.8.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.8.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 8:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wun wubibedo i doggola kema me rwatte pi nino abiro, kun wulubo gin ma Rwot ociko, wek pe wuto; pien gicika kit meno.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.8.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.8.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 8:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aron ki awobene gutiyo gin ducu ma Rwot yam ociko ki i dog Moses.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.8.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
